SUMMARY: Toronto Country Fest: The Allen Band
DESCRIPTION:The Allen Band is led by husband-and-wife duo Aaron and Aimee
  Allen\, who have been sharing the stage together for more than 20 years.
  Combining award-winning songwriting\, powerhouse vocals\, and genuine on
 stage chemistry\, they deliver an unforgettable show packed with energy\,
  heart\, and incredible musicianship. Backed by a phenomenal band\, The A
 llen Band delivers an electrifying\, feel good mix of award- winning orig
 inals alongside crowd- favorite country classics and anthems that keep au
 diences singing\, dancing\, and coming back for more.
