SUMMARY: Maplee Indoor Vendor Market
DESCRIPTION:Join us this summer for the Maplee Indoor Market at The Disti
 llery District\, located at 15 Mill Street in the heart of one of Toronto
 ’s most iconic destinations.\n\nStep inside and browse a curated selectio
 n of Canadian vendors featuring:\n\n• Art & design\n• Handmade goods & gi
 fts\n• Apparel & accessories\n• Beauty & wellness\n• Lifestyle brands\n• 
 Specialty food & beverage\n\nWhether you are looking to discover new loca
 l brands\, find unique products\, explore the historic Distillery Distric
 t\, or support Canadian small businesses\, the Maplee Indoor Market offer
 s a welcoming shopping experience for visitors of all ages.\n\n\n📍 The D
 istillery District\n15 Mill Street\, Toronto\, ON M5A 3C4\n\nAUGUST\n\n• 
 Saturday\, August 8\n• Sunday\, August 9\n• Saturday\, August 15\n• Sunda
 y\, August 16\n• Saturday\, August 22\n• Sunday\, August 23\n• Saturday\,
  August 29\n• Sunday\, August 30\n\nSEPTEMBER\n\n• Saturday\, September 5
  (Labour Day Weekend)\n• Sunday\, September 6 (Labour Day Weekend)\n• Mon
 day\, September 7 (Labour Day)\n• Saturday\, September 12\n• Sunday\, Sep
 tember 13\n• Saturday\, September 19\n• Sunday\, September 20\n\n⏰ 12:00 
 PM–6:00 PM\nAdmission is free and open to all ages.\n\n\nFOR VENDORS\n\nI
 nterested in becoming a vendor? Apply here! https://mapleecanada.ca/pages
 /vendor-market-applications\n\nMORE INFORMATION\n\nVisit our website http
 s://mapleecanada.ca or follow us on Instagram @mapleecanada https://www.i
 nstagram.com/mapleecanada/ .
CATEGORIES:market,vendormarket,free,local
