SUMMARY: Toronto Country Fest: Charissa
DESCRIPTION:Charissa is a Canadian singer-songwriter whose music is groun
 ded in storytelling and elevated by a voice that stops people in their tr
 acks. Warm\, rich and unmistakably her own\, Charissa has always carried 
 a big voice — one that feels both intimate and powerful\, capable of hold
 ing a room in complete stillness. Her songs move effortlessly between str
 ipped-down acoustic moments and full-band arrangements\, often weaving in
  experimental textures that push beyond genre boundaries\, blending Ameri
 cana\, soul\, folk and country. At the heart of it all is music rooted in
  vulnerability\, reflection and the courage to say what often goes unspok
 en.
