SUMMARY: Toronto Country Fest: Maddisun
DESCRIPTION:Born in the wilderness of Cranbrook\, BC\, Maddisun creates s
 ongwriter-folk with rootsy rock energy\, blending small-town energy with 
 big-star ambition. Her warm\, magnetic presence and powerful voice have m
 ade her a standout in Canada’s folk scene and beyond\, with Roots Music C
 anada praising her “larger-than-life onstage persona” and “huge voice\, m
 atched by her stage presence.”Maddisun continues to grow her audience thr
 ough international touring\, authentic storytelling\, and unforgettable l
 ive performances.
