SUMMARY: Toronto Country Fest: Rob Watts
DESCRIPTION:Formed in May 2015\, Rob Watts and his band are humbled to ha
 ve played hundreds of shows\, including a dream-come-true performance kic
 king off the last day of the festival at the Main Stage at Boots and Hear
 ts. Rob has an unquenchable thirst for performing live and always deliver
 s a high-energy\, crowd-involved show. He and his band make it their miss
 ion to put their heart and soul into each and every performance to make i
 t a show you won't soon forget.
