SUMMARY: Toronto Country Fest: Nicholas Cambell and Jamie Oliver
DESCRIPTION:Jamie Oliver and Nicholas Campbell are a duo made in heaven\,
  crooning honky tonk\, tight lush country harmonies and unmistakable ener
 gy on every stage they step on. The pair along with Matt Greco and Clayto
 n Yates call themselves The Odd Country\, a foot stomping honky tonk outf
 it based in Toronto Ontario. Listening to them is like dusting off your P
 eePaws old record collection of George Jones\, Hank Williams\, Merle Hagg
 ard\, Waylon Jennings\, and other golden country classics.
