SUMMARY: Toronto Country Fest: Ian James Bain
DESCRIPTION:Ian James Bain is a songwriter based in Hamilton\, ON. As the
  touring guitar player for Jeremie Albino and a core member of Nicolette 
 & the Nobodies\, Bain is no stranger to the road. Somewhere along the hig
 hway\, he found a voice of his own. His debut album 'Where I Wanna Be' wa
 s released in October of 2022\, establishing him as an important newcomer
  in the Canadian songwriter community. Bain continues to push his craft a
 nd look for new ways to tell stories about those timeless things that don
 ’t tire of being told. You can find him somewhere down the road.
