SUMMARY: Fall Music Series - Sapphire Sound Machine
DESCRIPTION:Emily Power and Rick Fairburn are the creative force behind S
 apphire Sound Machine\, delivering bespoke live music for the world’s mos
 t exceptional events. Award-winning songwriter and vocalist Emily captiva
 tes with a voice that is powerful\, elegant\, and deeply expressive\, bri
 nging sophistication and emotion to every performance. Accomplished multi
 -instrumentalist Rick commands the guitar and piano with exceptional arti
 stry\, instinctive musicality\, and effortless style. Together\, they cre
 ate an exquisite blend of pop\, classical\, Latin\, jazz\, and soul\, tai
 lored seamlessly to each occasion. From refined background ambience to ca
 ptivating feature performances\, Sapphire Sound Machine creates distincti
 ve musical experiences that elevate atmosphere\, inspire emotion\, and le
 ave a lasting impression.
