SUMMARY: The First Pour Weekend - Oktoberfest at The Distillery District\
 , poured by Mill Street Brewery
DESCRIPTION:Kick off Oktoberfest with a Bier Hall ticketed dining experie
 nce on opening weekend\, September 19 & 20. On Saturday\, September 19th 
 tickets are available from 4:30-8pm\, and Sunday\, September 20th from 2-
 7:30pm.\n\nFor $30+HST per ticket\, each guest will receive a platter ful
 l of Oktoberfest-inspired food\, a stein of Mill Street beer* and a seat 
 at the long tables on Trinity St\, beer hall style. Tickets are limited a
 nd available on a first-come\, first-served basis\, so be sure to secure 
 your spot early and raise a stein to the start of Oktoberfest! Head to Ev
 entbrite linked here The Distillery District Oktoberfest\, Poured by Mill
  St Tickets | Eventbrite https://www.eventbrite.ca/e/the-distillery-distr
 ict-oktoberfest-poured-by-mill-st-tickets-1999804040719?aff=oddtdtcreator
 &keep_tld=true to get your tickets.\n\n\n*Note: Event is 19+ only. Vegeta
 rian options are available at checkout which substitutes for a vegetarian
  sausage.
