SUMMARY: The Guilty Ones: A Spring Awakening Musical Singalong with BELT!
DESCRIPTION:Come for the angst. Stay for the scream-singing.\n\nTo kick o
 ff Soulpepper's first Public Tuesday of the season\, we’re throwing a ful
 l-blown Spring Awakening party\, centered around a singalong of the great
 est hits from the Tony Award-winning musical led by BELT! Expect playful 
 lobby activations\, photo-worthy moments and a few surprises along the wa
 y. Come scream-sing your favourites\, make some new friends and let all t
 hat repression out.\n\nNo experience necessary. Repressed feelings welcom
 e.\n\nMore information can be found here: https://soulpepper.ca/the-guilt
 y-ones-a-spring-awakening-singalong/ https://soulpepper.ca/the-guilty-one
 s-a-spring-awakening-singalong/ .
