SUMMARY: Oktoberfest at The Distillery District\, poured by Mill Street B
 rewery
DESCRIPTION:PROST Toronto! We’re excited to share that Oktoberfest is ret
 urning to The Distillery District for three weekends\, September 19 & 20\
 , September 26 & 27\, and October 3 & 4.\n\nProgramming will take place t
 hroughout the site from 2:00–9:00 PM each day\, with activities centered 
 around Trinity Square and the Pure Spirits Courtyard.\n\nThroughout all t
 hree weekends\, visitors can enjoy:\n\n  * Live polka music in Trinity Sq
 uare from 2:00–5:00 PM\n  * Live music and entertainment in the Pure Spir
 its Courtyard from 6:00–9:00 PM\n  * Oktoberfest Beer Pong every Saturday
  from 5:00–6:00 PM in the Pure Spirits Courtyard\n  * Oktoberfest Trivia 
 every Sunday from 5:00–6:00 PM in the Pure Spirits Courtyard\n  * Table g
 ames\n  * An Oktoberfest Feast Menu out of the Pure Spirits courtyard\n\n
 We encourage you to wear your lederhosen\, dance\, and make friends! Head
  to Oktoberfest - The Distillery District https://www.thedistillerydistri
 ct.com/oktoberfest/ to learn more.\n\n
CATEGORIES:music,Toronto
