SUMMARY: All Told: Lies My Parents Told Me
DESCRIPTION:Every family has a story that doesn’t quite add up.\n\nAn eve
 ning of true stories told by the people who lived them.\n\nJoin us on Oct
 ober 6th for Lies My Parents Told Me: twisted true tales from the people 
 who raised us. A night of white lies\, tall tales\, the family myths that
  fell apart at the worst possible moment\, and the tender truths hiding u
 nderneath them.\n\nStorytellers to be announced!\n\nMore information can 
 be found here: https://soulpepper.ca/all-told-lies-my-parents-told-me/ ht
 tps://soulpepper.ca/all-told-lies-my-parents-told-me/ .
