SUMMARY: Prom Night: Carrie (1976)
DESCRIPTION:Dress to kill. Dance all night. Try not to get crowned.\n\nIn
  celebration of the 50th anniversary of the iconic horror classic\, we pr
 esent a special screening of Carrie alongside partners Sleepless Cinema h
 ttps://sleeplesscinema.ca/ . Throw on your formalwear for a blood-soaked 
 evening of cinema\, 70’s music\, sweet treats\, photo ops and a prom cour
 t crowning.\n\nCarrie (1976): Withdrawn and sensitive teenager Carrie Whi
 te faces bullying from classmates and abuse from her fanatically pious mo
 ther. When she begins to suspect that she has supernatural powers\, thing
 s take a dark and violent turn.\n\nMore information and registration can 
 be found here: https://soulpepper.ca/prom-night-carrie/ https://soulpeppe
 r.ca/prom-night-carrie/ .
