SUMMARY: Repercussions Live! Midterms\, Municipal Politics & the Mess Bet
 ween Us
DESCRIPTION:Votes cast. Drinks poured. Consequences pending.\n\nOn the ni
 ght of the American midterms and in the shadow of Toronto’s municipal ele
 ction the week prior\, hosts Elamin Abdelmahmoud (CBC Commotion) and Joan
  Summers (Eating for Free) will dissect the state of our co-dependent pol
 itics and face the consequences of our collective decisions together. Dri
 nks\, games\, and discourse to ensue.\n\nMore information and registratio
 n can be found here: https://soulpepper.ca/repercussions-live/ https://so
 ulpepper.ca/repercussions-live/ .
CATEGORIES:free,gathering,election,politics
