SUMMARY: Toronto Star Live at Soulpepper: In Conversation with Jennifer S
 hahade The Next Move
DESCRIPTION:Jennifer Shahade on strategy\, power and seeing the board dif
 ferently.\n\nChess master Jennifer Shahade\, author of Thinking Sideways 
 and Chess Queens\, joins Star Opinion Editor Jordan Himelfarb\, author of
  his own book on chess\, for an interactive conversation about strategy\,
  decision-making and how to see the board differently when the obvious mo
 ve fails. Drawing on chess\, poker\, gender and power\, this event will i
 nvite audiences to think in moves\, countermoves and possibilities — and 
 to ask what changes when we stop looking for the right answer and start l
 ooking for the better move.\n\nMore information and tickets can be found 
 here: https://soulpepper.ca/toronto-star-live-the-next-move/ https://soul
 pepper.ca/toronto-star-live-the-next-move/ .
CATEGORIES:toronto-star,live-journalism,jennifer-shahade
