SUMMARY: Around the Table: A Dinner In Support of Daily Bread
DESCRIPTION:Good Food\, Good Company & a Greater Good\n\nIn the dark nigh
 ts of November leading up to the holiday season\, we invite the city to s
 hare and spread the warmth generated around a common table. Join Soulpepp
 er Theatre for a catered dinner to kick off a food drive for Daily Bread 
 Food Bank\, one of our city’s most vital organizations working to address
  food insecurity and poverty.\n\nGuests are asked to bring a minimum of o
 ne non-perishable food item from Daily Bread’s most needed item list:\n\n
   * Canned vegetables\n  * Canned tomatoes (whole\, diced\, crushed)\n  *
  Oatmeal\n  * Canned fruit\n  * Nut butter (almond\, peanut)\n  * Canned 
 fish (tuna\, salmon\, sardines)\n\nMore information and registration can 
 be found here: https://soulpepper.ca/around-the-table-a-dinner-in-support
 -of-daily-bread/ https://soulpepper.ca/around-the-table-a-dinner-in-suppo
 rt-of-daily-bread/ .
CATEGORIES:free,community-meal,food-drive
