SUMMARY: You've Got Mail & Shop Around the Corner Double Feature
DESCRIPTION:Nothing says the holidays like falling for the person you can
 ’t stand.\n\nJoin us for a double feature screening of Shop Around the Co
 rner and You’ve Got Mail\, two films inspired by Parfumerie\, the archety
 pal enemies-to-lovers romantic comedy.\n\nShop Around the Corner (1940): 
 Two employees at a gift shop can barely stand one another\, without reali
 zing that they are falling in love through the post as each other’s anony
 mous pen pal.\n\nYou’ve Got Mail (1998): A boutique bookshop owner and a 
 corporate chain store owner who despise each other in real life unwitting
 ly fall in love over the Internet.\n\nMore information and registration c
 an be found here: https://soulpepper.ca/youve-got-mail-shop-around-the-co
 rner-double-feature/ https://soulpepper.ca/youve-got-mail-shop-around-the
 -corner-double-feature/ .
